  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Large-scale energy supply curtailments that tighten markets and raise volatility trigger risk‑off moves by global investors and banks, prompting net capital outflows from export- and manufacturing‑dependent economies (including China) as portfolio and financing conditions tighten.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
