  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Spikes in executive turnover lead incoming officials to institute precautionary freezes and tighter vetting on outbound technology transfers while they reassess personnel and policy, producing sharper export-control measures in the near term.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
