  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A spike in U.S. executive turnover creates immediate uncertainty about U.S. security and diplomatic commitments, prompting coalition strain and policy scramble in vulnerable European governments that reduces their domestic stability.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
