  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid senior and mid-level turnover degrades continuity in operational planning and interagency coordination for patrols and convoys in the Strait of Hormuz, raising the near-term likelihood of gaps that hostile actors can exploit.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">united_states_realignmen</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_hormuz_escalation</data>
