  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">High turnover among executive staff disrupts continuity in procurement, licensing and interagency coordination, producing delays, missed contract deadlines and temporary pauses in arms transfers to Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
