  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Clear, consistent executive messaging reduces perceived policy risk and regulatory uncertainty, prompting foreign investors to increase net capital inflows to U.S. assets and ventures tied to technology sectors.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">united_states_realignmen</data>
