  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater coherence in U.S. executive messaging reduces ambiguous or contradictory signals that European newsrooms amplify, leading to a measurable drop in the volume and intensity of coverage linking U.S. developments to European political unrest.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">united_states_realignmen</data>
