  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Divergent or contradictory public statements from the executive create ambiguity about U.S. red lines and resolve, which Iranian commanders and affiliated proxy groups exploit by increasing tests and limited attacks to probe responses.</data>
