<edge source="china_tech_trade_rivalry::advanced_tech_share" target="europe_political_turbule::media_attention_intensit" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A rising share of advanced technologies in China-linked exports sharpens European strategic-dependency concerns, prompting sustained high-profile media coverage and investigative reporting on tech security and supply risks.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_tech_trade_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">europe_political_turbule</data>
</edge>
<edge source="china_tech_trade_rivalry::advanced_tech_share" target="iran_hormuz_escalation::maritime_security_risk" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A higher share of advanced technologies in Chinese exports raises the global availability of dual‑use maritime systems (unmanned vessels, guidance electronics, comms and ISR kit) that can be procured through third‑party traders and repurposed by Iran or its proxies to conduct more capable and disruptive attacks on shipping.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_tech_trade_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_hormuz_escalation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="china_tech_trade_rivalry::advanced_tech_share" target="russia_ukraine_war::arms_supply_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A higher share of advanced technologies in Chinese exports increases the availability of semiconductors, sensors and other dual‑use components that can be incorporated into Russian weapons or provided via intermediaries, accelerating production and deliveries of military hardware to Russian forces.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_tech_trade_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
