  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">When a larger share of exports consists of advanced technology, affected firms and industry groups face a higher probability of restrictive measures or licensing disputes and respond quickly with lawsuits and administrative petitions against executive actions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_tech_trade_rivalry</data>
