  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid tightening of export controls on high-tech items creates immediate earnings shocks and uncertainty for European firms with China exposure, triggering equity/bond repricing and liquidity swings in domestic markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_tech_trade_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">europe_political_turbule</data>
