  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher cross-border supply‑chain integration institutionalizes interagency and public‑private coordination routines (joint guidance, shared talking points), increasing consistency across executive communications; conversely, rapid breakdowns of integration remove those routines and reduce coherence.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_tech_trade_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">united_states_realignmen</data>
