  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Imposition of new tariffs and quotas on intermediate goods raises input costs and forces layoffs or factory slowdowns in export-dependent EU regions, producing localized labor and community protests.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_tech_trade_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">europe_political_turbule</data>
