  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter trade barriers increase logistical friction and uncertainty in China‑centered trade flows, prompting precautionary crude buying and reducing effective tanker and storage capacity, which tightens physical oil markets and lifts benchmark prices.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_tech_trade_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_hormuz_escalation</data>
