  <data key="d36">Tighter trade barriers imposed on or around China prompt Beijing (and Chinese firms) to compensate by facilitating alternative trade, finance and transshipment channels for sanctioned Russian sectors and counterparties, blunting the effective intensity of Western sanctions on Russia.</data>
